<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch July cash retail sales rise 5.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch July cash retail sales rise 5.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch retail sales rose 5.4 percent in cash terms in July compared with July 1995, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.</p>
<p>In volume terms July retail sales were also 5.4 percent higher than in July 1995, the CBS added.</p>
</text>
